---
import SiteLayout from "@/layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy & cookies"
  description="How Dorset Antiques uses the details you share in an enquiry."
>
  <Section class="page-intro legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="h2">Privacy & cookies</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      An enquiry asks only for your name, email address and message. Those
      details are used to reply to you about a piece, its price, condition or
      delivery. They are not sold, and they are not used for a mailing list.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      This site does not take payment and does not ask you to create an account.
      Essential cookies, if the browser stores any, are used only to keep the
      site working. There is no advertising or analytics tracker on these pages.
    </p>
    <p class="muted">
      To ask for a copy of an enquiry you have sent, or to ask us to delete it,
      write to the same address you used to contact the collection.
    </p>
  </Section>
</SiteLayout>
